<PracticeSet />

<AtTheTable>

Separate running below a model’s expectation from evidence that the model is accurate. Review recorded decisions and assumptions before attributing a downswing to either skill or luck.

</AtTheTable>

<QuantCorner>

Forecast scores reward honest probability estimates over repeated outcomes. A p-value and a scoring rule answer different questions; neither replaces independent validation.

</QuantCorner>
